<title>UK: DePfa sets 1.0 bln French franc FRN/fixed bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 1.0 bln French franc FRN/fixed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Credit Commercial de France.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   SPREAD  ** 15 BP     MATURITY    30.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE   FRN/FIXED     BASE	 3M PIBOR  PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES   ** FOR ONE YEAR, THEN 4.0 PCT FIXED COUPON</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/DE  NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER A DEBT PROGRAMME</p>
